# Product name: Vyomel

The product, package, CLI, env prefix, metrics, GitHub repo, and local checkout are **Vyomel** / `vyomel`. No Astra leftovers — no exceptions.

| Surface | Correct | Forbidden |
|---|---|---|
| Display / docs | Vyomel | Astra |
| Python package / imports | `vyomel` | `astra` |
| CLI entrypoint | `vyomel` | `astra` |
| Env vars | `VYOMEL_*` | `ASTRA_*` |
| Prometheus metrics | `vyomel_*` | `astra_*` |
| Errors | `VyomelError` | `AstraError` |
| Workspace dir | `.vyomel/` | `.astra/` |
| GitHub | `JayYarlagadda/vyomel` | any `astra` GitHub path |
| Local checkout | `D:/Vyomel` | any `Astra` folder path |

If you see the old product name anywhere, rename it to the Vyomel equivalent.
